          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "садовник (sadóvnik) is сад, \"a garden\", with -овник, \"a person\": a gardener. сад comes from садить, \"to plant\", the \"make sit\" form of сидеть, \"to sit\" (Vasmer)."
